ATTRIBUTION REQUIRED FOR THE TEST CONTENT

The 16 ICAR Sample Test items (text, images, response keys) used in this
project are derived from:

    Condon, D. M., & Revelle, W. (2014).
    The international cognitive ability resource: Development and initial
    validation of a public-domain measure.
    Intelligence, 43, 52-64.
    https://doi.org/10.1016/j.intell.2014.01.004

The original ICAR-16 items are released under a Creative Commons license by
the ICAR Project (https://icar-project.com). Scoring keys were obtained from
the open-source R package `psychTools::iqitems` maintained by William Revelle
(https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=psychTools).

When redistributing or building upon this work, please credit both the
original ICAR authors and this Italian adaptation.
